### security_bulletins

The security_bulletins collection stores vendor or aggregator advisories, including CVEs where applicable. Bulletins may link to indicators and include references for authoritative tracking. Metadata fields cover disclosure timeline, affected products, and patch or mitigation guidance.

Schema highlights:

- Required fields: _id, schema_version, created_at, updated_at, ingested_at, source, references[], title, summary, published_at, severity, affected_products[], patched (bool).
- Types: published_at, updated_at as timestamps; affected_products as array of strings; CVSS vectors as strings; references array with defined subfields; optional indicators array for bulletin-linked indicators.
- Extensions: vendor-specific fields captured in a map.
- Patch status: patched boolean.

Table 5: security_bulletins Fields and Constraints

| Field/Subfield                     | Type            | Required | Validation Notes                                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| schema_version                    | string          | Yes      | Non-empty string.                                                                                |
| created_at, updated_at            | timestamp       | Yes      | bsonType “date”.                                                                                 |
| ingested_at                       | timestamp       | Yes      | bsonType “date”.                                                                                 |
| bulletin_id                       | string          | No       | Stable ID if provided by source.                                                                 |
| source                            | object          | Yes      | Subfields as in Table 3; reference_id required.                                                 |
| title                             | string          | Yes      | Non-empty; length ≤ 512.                                                                         |
| summary                           | string          | Yes      | Non-empty; length ≤ 8192.                                                                        |
| published_at                      | timestamp       | Yes      | bsonType “date”.                                                                                 |
| updated_at                        | timestamp       | Yes      | bsonType “date”.                                                                                 |
| severity                          | object          | Yes      | level enum; score int 0–100.                                                                     |
| cve_ids[]                         | string          | No       | Each CVE like “CVE-YYYY-NNNN”.                                                                  |
| cvss_v3_score                     | double          | No       | 0.0–10.0.                                                                                        |
| cvss_v3_vector                    | string          | No       | CVSS v3 vector string.                                                                           |
| affected_products[]               | string          | Yes      | Array of product names; length ≤ 4096.                                                          |
| patched                           | bool            | Yes      | Patch status.                                                                                    |
| references[]                      | object          | Yes      | type enum, reference_id string, title string, publisher string.                                  |
| indicators[]                      | object          | No       | As in Table 3; optional linkage to bulletin content.                                             |
| extensions                        | object          | No       | Vendor-specific metadata map.                                                                    |
| raw                               | object          | No       | Optional snapshot of original bulletin.                                                         |
| history, audit                    | object/array    | No       | Change tracking and audit metadata.                                                              |

